<title>NORWAY: BIATHLON-LEADING WORLD CUP BIATHLON RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BIATHLON-LEADING WORLD CUP BIATHLON RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HOLMENKOLLEN, Norway 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading results in a</p>
<p>World Cup biathlon events on Sunday:</p>
<p>Women's relay 4 x 7.5 km:</p>
<p>1. Russia (Olga Melnik, Galina Kukleva, Nadejda Talanova,</p>
<p>Olga Romasko)		    one hour 36 minutes 12.8 seconds</p>
<p>2. Germany (Uschi Disl, Simone Greiner-Petter-Memm, Katrin</p>
<p>Apel, Petra Behle) 0:17.5 minutes behind</p>
<p>3. Norway (Ann-Elen Skjelbreid, Annette Sikveland, Hildegunn</p>
<p>Fossen Mikkelsplass, Gunn Margit Andreassen)   3:33.7</p>
<p> 4. France						 3:52.5</p>
<p> 5. Czech Republic				     5:12.2</p>
<p> 6. Sweden						 5:32.9</p>
<p> 7. Belarus						6:58.8</p>
<p> 8. Finland						7:00.0</p>
<p> 9. China						  7:32.2</p>
<p>10. Ukraine						7:58.5</p>
</text>
